<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="rijksvideo-transcription-880">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
                    <p>Video title is visible in animation: How do I as a recognised sponsor hire an employee from abroad. Instruction video.<br>
Voice-over: How do I, as a recognised sponsor, hire an employee from abroad?<br>
You are a recognised sponsor and you would like to hire an employee from abroad. <br>
Your employee needs a residence permit for this purpose. And usually also a special entry visa, an mvv.<br>
You can apply for the residence permit and mvv from the IND together, in 5 steps.<br>
Step 1. Read the conditions on www.ind.nl. There you will find all the residence permits for work.<br>
And the conditions, rights and obligations associated with each residence permit.<br>
Which permit your employee needs depends, among other things, on the position and salary grade.<br>
Step 2. Complete the application form. You can submit the application in writing, or online in the Business Portal.<br>
In the form, you should state that your employee meets the conditions.<br>
You do not have to send the documents showing this together with the application form. Instead, you should keep them.<br>
Step 3. Pay for the application. Find out on ind.nl how much the application costs.<br>
On the application form you can give the IND permission to debit the costs with a direct debit.<br>
Or you can wait for the letter advising how you can pay. Step 4. Wait for the decision.<br>
Have you paid for the application? Then the IND has 90 days to make a decision. <br>
This is called the decision period. Did you use direct debit? Then a decision is often taken within two weeks. <br>
It will take longer if your application is incomplete or further information is needed.<br>
In that case you will be notified and the decision period may be extended.<br>
Step 5. The decision.If your application has been rejected and you disagree, you can apply for review. <br>
If the decision is positive, you will receive a message about collecting the mvv or residence permit.<br>
Would you like to submit an application? Please visit www.ind.nl.<br>
Text in animation: Would you like to submit an application? visit www.ind.nl<br>
</p>
        
